  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="RHINOCEROS">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The rhinoceros, a magnificent and majestic animal, is observed casually hanging out in a zoo enclosure or wildlife park. It appears content and possibly in a zen state, as it strolls around, munching on grass and enjoying a sunny day.</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542,7f9a74e3a14e39a9d1c84fe7b4cff52c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ZOO ENCLOSURE">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Well-fenced area with metal and wooden barriers, housing the rhinoceros and featuring lush greenery and trees</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FALLEN LOG">
      <data key="d0">OBJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">A large fallen log in the foreground of the rhino's enclosure, potentially a play area for the rhino</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LION CUTOUT">
      <data key="d0">OBJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">A majestic cardboard cutout of a lion, detailed and placed in a sunny outdoor setting</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PERSON">
      <data key="d0">HUMAN</data>
      <data key="d1">PERSON is an individual who was observed engaging in various activities at a zoo. They were seen at the giraffe feeding area, described as wearing a casual dark T-shirt and white earbuds, and appeared excited about feeding the giraffes. Additionally, PERSON was spotted posing next to a lion cutout, wearing a dark blue "Roots" T-shirt and holding a drink. In another instance, they were observed through glass taking a picture or video of penguins, wearing a casual shirt and focused on capturing the moment.</data>
      <data key="d2">5185e6c9f249476902ed52493324afe8,5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542,9590ddd0c984852bdfcd1ef80ae8184c,9c65f3dca9ad008e44f463dec34d57f9,e343b6fc4fc15c701802319fca7f2111</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LION">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">LION is a majestic big cat featured in an exhibit, where it is often seen lounging on a rock within its enclosure. It enjoys sunny days and appears relaxed, often noted for its peaceful slumber and majestic appearance.</data>
      <data key="d2">5185e6c9f249476902ed52493324afe8,5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LION ENCLOSURE">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Enclosure with a sturdy chain-link fence, lush greenery, and rocks, housing the lion</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EDUCATIONAL SIGN">
      <data key="d0">OBJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "EDUCATIONAL SIGN" at Seneca Park Zoo serves as an informative tool for visitors, offering insights into various animal behaviors and characteristics. One sign provides details about the relationship between giraffes and zebras in their natural habitat, enhancing visitor understanding of these species' interactions. Another sign discusses the differences between cats that can roar and those that can purr, presenting the information in a playful and engaging manner to captivate the audience's interest. These signs collectively aim to educate zoo visitors about animal life in an interactive and enjoyable way.</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542,9590ddd0c984852bdfcd1ef80ae8184c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="CHEETAH IMAGE">
      <data key="d0">OBJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">Image of a cheetah mid-purr on the educational sign, depicted as content and relaxed</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LION IMAGE">
      <data key="d0">OBJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">Image of a lion mid-roar on the educational sign, showing off its vocal capabilities</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AFTERNOON">
      <data key="d0">TIME</data>
      <data key="d1">The time of day described as afternoon, characterized by bright sunlight and shadows in the zoo settings</data>
      <data key="d2">5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ZOO">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">ZOO refers to a facility where a diverse range of animals, including sea lions, lynx, giraffes, zebras, rhinoceros, lions, and the African Elephant, are housed within enclosures and displayed to the public. This facility is not only a place for animal care but also engages in global conservation efforts and educational activities. Events such as ZooCamp, awareness days, and musical performances with dances are held to enhance visitor engagement and promote wildlife conservation. The zoo is open year-round, except on Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Day, and New Year's Day. Additionally, it offers animal interactions and membership programs to further involve the community in its conservation and educational missions. Notable locations within the zoo include well-maintained habitats like that of the African Elephant and the Seneca Park Zoo, which is a hub for various events, conservation efforts, and membership programs.</data>
      <data key="d2">147e8049d7528fb16973a779f3b5c903,1cb71251823c004ebcfe91eef39fc913,25244450e63663bca5ac126d6ed1c735,28d6bea29ebc6c0484b83527f534556b,3b1f9ee615cb8af34064946e8bbc5653,5f5e0cc857dfa4292355432eb1b09542,6d14ad0fec20f957fa86ed5bba9c5842,7e4abb755a8debc751dc717377114f5a,8910b045a5c0843c336e9ebc84c072ec,9590ddd0c984852bdfcd1ef80ae8184c,96e99f9fd96747bdb6ff5b3b0c603919,982d05dc3c9833fd0762b2eb346d79a0,9a382f591b41ffbb74f1a4a98b799b04,9b7c814666ecc42fbf1a45118e7f2977,b0b9a7e2f9c8c13b352787d0d7c78fe6,b444a72d50d13af97d816c1ebde75f41,d56c4a6bca5c5dd78d9ea535e6b1ce2b,da288d535b2debcfbed9d301b921a7cd,db81d705b7a122acf504e0d62904dc66,e3c5b5a66202ce1617b0ce83eb744e23,f852d4fb9eeece13b559d38077322cb8</data>
    </node>
