    <node id="ZOO VISIT">
      <data key="d0">ACTIVITY</data>
      <data key="d1">A "ZOO VISIT" refers to the activity of visiting a zoo, where individuals can enjoy animal exhibits and lush greenery. The perfect weather conditions enhance the experience, making it an ideal setting for observing wildlife and exploring natural habitats.</data>
      <data key="d2">5185e6c9f249476902ed52493324afe8,7f9a74e3a14e39a9d1c84fe7b4cff52c</data>
    </node>
