    <node id="CRATER CANTEEN">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CRATER CANTEEN is a charming outdoor caf&#233; located within the zoo, known for its rustic appearance and vibrant setting. It operates as a seasonal food service facility with varying hours depending on the time of year. Additionally, it serves as a venue where the musical piece 'Five Frogs' is performed. It is important to note that during certain events, regular food service at CRATER CANTEEN may not be available.</data>
      <data key="d2">5185e6c9f249476902ed52493324afe8,bb91ca31332be3d1e54ad385275e6284,e3c5b5a66202ce1617b0ce83eb744e23,f4312fae324599a53376de32cd0ef6f6</data>
    </node>
