    <node id="GIRAFFE">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The giraffe is a majestic and tall animal, known for its graceful elegance and long neck. It has an intricate, mosaic-like coat and is often a star attraction in zoos. In such settings, the giraffe is typically seen stretching its neck towards trees or interacting with its environment. It is also a featured animal in the Savanna Safari Tour, where it is available for feeding encounters. This animal's unique appearance and behavior make it a captivating subject for photographs and a favorite among zoo visitors.</data>
      <data key="d2">7f9a74e3a14e39a9d1c84fe7b4cff52c,93b8cec1c161812c432a361ca9f5e110,9590ddd0c984852bdfcd1ef80ae8184c,9c65f3dca9ad008e44f463dec34d57f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ZEBRA">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The zebra, an animal with distinctive black and white stripes, is a unique and mesmerizing species found at Seneca Park Zoo. It is known for its presence in zoo settings and its oblivious nature to surroundings, as humorously depicted in a photograph where a zebra makes a cameo with a giraffe. Zebras are featured prominently in the zoo's offerings, including the Savanna Safari Tour and the Savanna Tour, where guests can encounter these animals. Additionally, zebras are highlighted in this year's design and are one of the animals featured on the zoo's member t-shirts for 2024. Recently, a third zebra has been added to the group at Seneca Park Zoo, enhancing the experience for visitors.</data>
      <data key="d2">2aff8b93e799e360f021a8d30f349244,6f62d2860d0f3958caa46b6051845518,71689b592d158eb0ce63f039bec96cbd,7f9a74e3a14e39a9d1c84fe7b4cff52c,93b8cec1c161812c432a361ca9f5e110,9590ddd0c984852bdfcd1ef80ae8184c,9c65f3dca9ad008e44f463dec34d57f9,db81d705b7a122acf504e0d62904dc66</data>
