      <data key="d1">The Giraffe Feeding Area is a designated section within a zoo or park specifically designed for the feeding of giraffes. It is equipped with a rustic wooden canopy and a wooden structure, along with a sign that announces the feeding activity. This area allows visitors to observe and sometimes participate in the feeding process under controlled conditions.</data>
