    <node id="SENECA PARK ZOO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Seneca Park Zoo is a dynamic institution deeply involved in conservation, education, and community engagement. It is home to a diverse array of animal species including river otters, plains zebras, Mombasa golden starburst tarantula, Mueller's clawed frog, naked mole rat, East African spiny-tailed lizards, Masai giraffes, Olive Baboon, Ring-neck Parakeet, Speckled Mousebird, red pandas, African elephants, Domestic Rat, Fire-Bellied Toad, New Caledonian Crested Gecko, Madagascar hissing cockroaches, Madagascar tree boas, white rhino, and African lion. The zoo is committed to various conservation efforts such as funding tree nurseries, supporting global conservation initiatives, and partnering with organizations to protect endangered species and their habitats. It also focuses on educational programs that promote environmental protection and awareness, including signs about invasive species like the Spotted Lanternfly.

Seneca Park Zoo actively updates its Conservation Action Plan annually and participates in regional conservation efforts. It is part of the FrogWatch USA network and is involved in the restoration of lake sturgeon, emphasizing public education and ecosystem health. The zoo offers a range of experiences such as animal encounters, feeding experiences, private events, travel programs, and educational trips. It also hosts multiple events like Elephant Awareness Day, Fall Fest, ZooBrew, and Spooktacular, and offers various membership levels to engage the community further.

Additionally, the zoo conducts biosurvey and citizen science-based programs to promote stewardship of the local area and conducts environmental conservation activities. It is known for its SAFE program and scientific research aimed at promoting species survival and sustainability. The zoo ensures the safety of both its animals and guests through specific policies and offers volunteer opportunities to foster deeper community involvement.</data>
      <data key="d2">004c5ce5139f85c3462d8c6d33d0eb2c,012abaca5ac0051ac1d5f45b5ef82a3d,02ed48373f13fe54d7540874b5d52187,0fc43ac1990ac497fc8887d975c38133,1920dabee80be92a5381e744037b0659,19fd40a0ecae55e9d92fa6c64b312c42,1e20e07194c6b756df1b77ab0d6b272b,258b72191485f555888b5c9fa62c58e7,2690f9504dfb56154145abcec34c3c4f,28d6bea29ebc6c0484b83527f534556b,2aff8b93e799e360f021a8d30f349244,2b89d8d78551f6e57634773ac63b6eb8,2c20259c06c872b8077b598161f55f87,37c417e9fb3db505eeeaa12d3f028e77,3a13fc10eb422fca000ef83965be7c54,45d8d5e706be27731202735287418cab,48f339f528142c5c993c7020c8b79320,4f0216fbf293d41283768fcf5c6a176f,4fdb8dedb8854ac8f2c3684c3fb89524,532641424d1ac585278bb60c24a09a1c,55e333329ce5a8bb7e63f67578138cd3,56955a6240521bdd59e742c5f6dbeb24,5a67e66d1245cd5cad2cb1484b951ab5,5b32cc9af4441f9451a68576d6befb8c,5f6c454baab0626e35f40eeabb8bdf80,6354236108300d1756e9d76092de513b,6b7a0d76ac7b261edd3cb3d5ae6ec68f,6f1f7afb3432ea20d5ab00e0cb6cf1a3,6f62d2860d0f3958caa46b6051845518,71689b592d158eb0ce63f039bec96cbd,71e73f97d564b8d56227d2c4f76c45bd,807d66922b9b185cfc13dde4cefa5199,816a009cefed9fccfd6014e0e80fb540,8a4ff50d66bebd669f478e706f701304,937ae63cfd0860b674756ae48deb18d1,93b8cec1c161812c432a361ca9f5e110,9693c6d355708849ecd97fe93b0cd8f2,9b7c814666ecc42fbf1a45118e7f2977,9c65f3dca9ad008e44f463dec34d57f9,9fbeec723e4f071989819b22d7317dc6,b2d180d00dbf4721b8ae9121fe3bd2b5,bb91ca31332be3d1e54ad385275e6284,d2184be7e511a3e17181c7514ba580e8,d929c89af727d93966fdfa5f843ed8c6,db81d705b7a122acf504e0d62904dc66,e3c5b5a66202ce1617b0ce83eb744e23,e4a5ea254e91502ea1e808cd4bf5d6d8,e9b8eaf510aa9cc4cf1ab929ac8c9706,ede5b69e131b6efb49c20f681226707c,f4312fae324599a53376de32cd0ef6f6,f4b84d8469e84e31e4d8c0f2241ebb94,f7d18cffd13aa901313d3d4fceef2575,fdad927a279adcc084120bd45b615091</data>
