    </node>
    <node id="TRAILSIDE CAF&#201;">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION, BUSINESS</data>
      <data key="d1">Trailside Caf&#233; is a newly established caf&#233; located within Seneca Park Zoo, as announced by Monroe County Executive Adam Bello. This caf&#233; not only offers food services but does so with a commitment to sustainable practices. It utilizes reusable plates and utensils, and serves water in aluminum bottles, emphasizing environmental responsibility. Trailside Caf&#233; combines modern technology with delicious food options, featuring an interactive touchscreen kiosk for ordering and a well-organized beverage display. Additionally, it serves as a contemporary indoor event space suitable for corporate gatherings, family celebrations, and more, making it a versatile venue within the zoo.</data>
      <data key="d2">30c61f2e8eb9ec787335dd5146b1dcd3,3151bb5c0b7a18f5142a741f163a92cd,3a13fc10eb422fca000ef83965be7c54,5a67e66d1245cd5cad2cb1484b951ab5,816a009cefed9fccfd6014e0e80fb540,b444a72d50d13af97d816c1ebde75f41,e9b8eaf510aa9cc4cf1ab929ac8c9706</data>
    </node>
