    <node id="PARKING">
      <data key="d0">SERVICE</data>
      <data key="d1">Parking at Seneca Park includes several open lots where parking is available for free. Additionally, VIP parking can be purchased as an add-on. The zoo also provides handicap parking spaces, which are offered on a first-come, first-served basis.</data>
      <data key="d2">1cb71251823c004ebcfe91eef39fc913,f4312fae324599a53376de32cd0ef6f6</data>
    </node>
