    <node id="RIT">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Rochester Institute of Technology (RIT) is an academic institution that has established a partnership with Seneca Park Zoo to study otters and engage in other scientific research. This collaboration is formalized through a partnership agreement with the Seneca Park Zoo Society. Additionally, RIT is involved in environmental initiatives, such as the Great Lakes Plastic Pollution Cleanups, highlighting its commitment to both academic research and community environmental efforts.</data>
      <data key="d2">37c417e9fb3db505eeeaa12d3f028e77,807d66922b9b185cfc13dde4cefa5199,b444a72d50d13af97d816c1ebde75f41,f7d18cffd13aa901313d3d4fceef2575</data>
