      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Monroe County is a local government entity involved in a variety of community and environmental initiatives. The county executive, Adam Bello, frequently makes announcements concerning events and activities, including those at Seneca Park Zoo. Monroe County is active in environmental projects such as vape device collection and disposal programs, and also partners in environmental cleanup events. Additionally, the county is home to the Rochester Energy Efficiency and Weatherization (RENEW) program, which impacts homeowners by improving energy efficiency and weatherization.</data>
