      <data key="d1">The Seth Green Park Cleanup is a community event dedicated to cleaning up Seth Green Park. It is part of the ROC the Riverway initiative, which focuses on revitalizing and enhancing the riverway areas. This specific event brings together community members to collectively contribute to the cleanliness and maintenance of Seth Green Park, ensuring it remains a beautiful and welcoming space for all visitors.</data>
