    <node id="SMITHSONIAN INSTITUTION">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The Smithsonian Institution is a renowned organization that actively engages in scientific research and educational initiatives. Among its diverse projects, its scientists are part of the One Cubic Foot team in Madagascar, which focuses on biodiversity research. Additionally, the Smithsonian operates a 'Think Tank' at the National Zoo in Washington D.C., dedicated to studying primate thought processes and decision-making. This highlights the Institution's commitment to advancing knowledge in both environmental science and animal cognition.</data>
      <data key="d2">2690f9504dfb56154145abcec34c3c4f,9b7c814666ecc42fbf1a45118e7f2977</data>
