      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Conservation Days are special events held at the zoo, dedicated to raising awareness about various wildlife species and conservation efforts. These days involve a range of conservation activities and are supported by sponsors, enhancing the educational impact and outreach of the events.</data>
