    <node id="COLD ASIA AWARENESS WEEKEND">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cold Asia Awareness Weekend, scheduled for the year 2024, is an event hosted at the zoo that focuses on the wildlife and environment of cold-climate regions in Asia. This awareness event aims to immerse visitors in the world of cold-climate species from Asia, such as Snow Leopards and Red Pandas. It features expert talks and experiences, providing insights from expert naturalists who specialize in these unique ecosystems. The event is designed to educate and engage attendees on the importance and intricacies of cold-climate animals from Asia.</data>
      <data key="d2">1e20e07194c6b756df1b77ab0d6b272b,360b21cff28e96518b1080330f37b4f1,37145c80bbad9e7bb1716a1e0492645e,79a2d4b637ef8098cbe540902636ddbf,937ae63cfd0860b674756ae48deb18d1,9b7c814666ecc42fbf1a45118e7f2977</data>
