      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">RISE AND SHINE CART TOURS is a recurring guided golf cart tour event at the Seneca Park Zoo, scheduled for the year 2024 as part of the summer programming. These 90-minute tours allow participants to experience the zoo as the animals start their day, providing educational insights about the animals. This event is mentioned multiple times in the document, highlighting its significance and continuity in the zoo's array of activities.</data>
