      <data key="d1">The Cordancia Chamber Orchestra and BIODANCE are featured in a special event held at the zoo. This event includes musical performances and dance, specifically focusing on musical pieces about animals. It takes place during afterhours admission as part of the zoo's summer programming. This unique experience allows attendees to enjoy the artistic presentations in the context of a zoo visit.</data>
