    <node id="ZOOBREW">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">ZOOBREW is an annual, recurring summer event series hosted by Seneca Park Zoo, specifically designed as an after-hours happy hour for adults aged 21 and over. Scheduled for September 6, 2024, this event marks its 20th season and features brew tasting and other entertainment activities. ZOOBREW is not only a social gathering but also serves a philanthropic purpose, as ticket sales contribute to elephant conservation efforts, aiming to save elephants from extinction. It's important to note that motorized wheelchairs are not permitted at the event. This unique combination of leisure and conservation makes ZOOBREW a notable event in the community calendar.</data>
