    <node id="ANIMALS OF THE SAVANNA BUILDING">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Animals of the Savanna Building" is a specific facility located within Seneca Park Zoo. This building offers a unique behind-the-scenes experience where guests can meet various animals, including the white rhino. Additionally, it houses a variety of species such as speckled mousebirds, superb starlings, and Taveta golden weavers, providing a diverse viewing experience for zoo visitors.</data>
      <data key="d2">0e82357242396a0c25a818c5edb5e69d,8a4ff50d66bebd669f478e706f701304,93b8cec1c161812c432a361ca9f5e110</data>
    </node>
    <node id="RHINO ENCOUNTERS">
