      <data key="d1">MEMBERSHIP at Seneca Park Zoo is a program that allows individuals to join or renew their membership for a full year. It offers various levels of membership, each providing different benefits and access to the zoo. Additionally, the program includes options for gift memberships, allowing members to share the experience with others.</data>
