    <node id="ANIMAL PRESENTATIONS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Animal Presentations at the zoo offer interactive learning experiences that involve live animals and activities, designed to engage visitors in understanding wildlife and conservation efforts.</data>
      <data key="d2">bb91ca31332be3d1e54ad385275e6284,d56c4a6bca5c5dd78d9ea535e6b1ce2b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EXPEDITIONS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">EXPEDITIONS are field study experiences led by a Zoo Educator, designed to be thematic, interactive, and inquiry-based. These experiences take place in and around the Zoo and are tailored to meet educational standards. Participants are required to book these experiences in advance to partake in the structured and engaging learning opportunities provided.</data>
      <data key="d2">307425bd69f432748e5a594b85aeccc1,bb91ca31332be3d1e54ad385275e6284,d56c4a6bca5c5dd78d9ea535e6b1ce2b</data>
