    <node id="ANIMAL FACTS">
      <data key="d0">SECTION</data>
      <data key="d1">"ANIMAL FACTS" is a section in the document that offers comprehensive and detailed information about various animals. It includes facts about their diets, habitats, and statuses in the wild, as well as other factual data pertinent to each species. This section serves as a resource for understanding the dietary preferences and environmental needs of different animals.</data>
      <data key="d2">02ed48373f13fe54d7540874b5d52187,276b3724b32d115ba04f28d3aead11c1,48f339f528142c5c993c7020c8b79320,b2d180d00dbf4721b8ae9121fe3bd2b5,d929c89af727d93966fdfa5f843ed8c6,da288d535b2debcfbed9d301b921a7cd,fdad927a279adcc084120bd45b615091</data>
