    <node id="CITES APPENDIX II">
      <data key="d0">CONSERVATION AGREEMENT</data>
      <data key="d1">CITES Appendix II is an international agreement under the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora. It specifically regulates the trade and protection of certain wildlife species, including African lions. The agreement indicates specific regulations on the trade and conservation of these species to ensure their protection.</data>
      <data key="d2">02ed48373f13fe54d7540874b5d52187,360b21cff28e96518b1080330f37b4f1</data>
    </node>
