    <node id="CONSERVATION ACTION PLAN">
      <data key="d0">SECTION</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Conservation Action Plan" is a strategic framework created and implemented by Seneca Park Zoo, as well as other zoos and aquariums accredited by the Association of Zoos and Aquariums (AZA), to fulfill their mission of conservation and education. This plan, which is updated annually at Seneca Park Zoo, includes five-year goals and annual objectives. It encompasses various conservation efforts and actions, and is a key section in discussions about the zoo's conservation initiatives.</data>
