      <data key="d1">The domestic rabbit is mentioned as a species in various contexts related to Africa and zoological settings. It is included in a list of animals from Africa and specifically highlighted in the 'More Animals From Africa' section. Additionally, it is noted as one of the animals present in a zoo. This indicates that the domestic rabbit is recognized for its presence both in African regions and in controlled environments like zoos.</data>
