      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Dumeril&#8217;s Ground Boa is a species of boa native to Madagascar, which is also mentioned in various documents as part of a zoo's collection. It is listed under the 'More Animals From Africa' section, indicating its geographical association with Africa, despite being specifically from Madagascar. This species is recognized as one of the animals in the zoo and is included in the list of animals from Africa.</data>
