    <node id="EAST AFRICAN SPINY-TAILED LIZARD">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The East African spiny-tailed lizard is a species native to East Africa, specifically found from the southern coast of Kenya to eastern Zimbabwe and central Mozambique. It prefers dry forest habitats and has a carnivorous diet. This lizard is included in the zoo's collection and is featured in the 'More Animals From Africa' section, highlighting its significance among the animals from Africa.</data>
      <data key="d2">0e82357242396a0c25a818c5edb5e69d,0fc43ac1990ac497fc8887d975c38133,5b32cc9af4441f9451a68576d6befb8c,8a4ff50d66bebd669f478e706f701304,fdad927a279adcc084120bd45b615091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GIANT AFRICAN MILLIPEDE">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The Giant African Millipede is a species of millipede native to Africa, specifically found throughout Tanzania in rainforests. It is one of the largest millipede species and feeds on organic matter and decayed plant material. This species is part of the zoo's collection and is featured in the 'More Animals From Africa' section, highlighting its significance among the animals from Africa.</data>
      <data key="d2">0e82357242396a0c25a818c5edb5e69d,0fc43ac1990ac497fc8887d975c38133,5b32cc9af4441f9451a68576d6befb8c,8a4ff50d66bebd669f478e706f701304,fdad927a279adcc084120bd45b615091</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GIANT DAY GECKO">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The Giant Day Gecko is a species of gecko native to Madagascar, commonly found in rainforests and often near human settlements. This gecko is part of the zoo's collection and is also featured inside the E.C.O. Center. It has a carnivorous diet that includes invertebrates, nectar, and occasionally small vertebrates. The Giant Day Gecko is mentioned in the document as one of the animals from Africa and is listed in the 'More Animals From Africa' section.</data>
      <data key="d2">0e82357242396a0c25a818c5edb5e69d,0fc43ac1990ac497fc8887d975c38133,276b3724b32d115ba04f28d3aead11c1,5b32cc9af4441f9451a68576d6befb8c,8a4ff50d66bebd669f478e706f701304,fdad927a279adcc084120bd45b615091</data>
    </node>
