      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The Golden-breasted Starling is a bird species native to Africa and is part of the zoo's collection. It is specifically mentioned in the document as one of the animals from Africa and is included in the 'More Animals From Africa' section of the list. This species of starling is highlighted as an example of the diverse wildlife housed at the zoo.</data>
