    </node>
    <node id="GREAT PLATED LIZARD">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The Great Plated Lizard is a species of lizard native to Africa, specifically found in eastern Kenya, Tanzania, and Mozambique. It inhabits rocky hills and has a diet that includes fruits, leaves, insects, spiders, and in conservation settings, small mice and dog food. This lizard is mentioned in various documents as part of a zoo's collection and is highlighted in the 'More Animals From Africa' section, indicating its presence among the animals from Africa showcased in the zoo.</data>
      <data key="d2">0e82357242396a0c25a818c5edb5e69d,0fc43ac1990ac497fc8887d975c38133,276b3724b32d115ba04f28d3aead11c1,5b32cc9af4441f9451a68576d6befb8c,6d14ad0fec20f957fa86ed5bba9c5842,8a4ff50d66bebd669f478e706f701304,fdad927a279adcc084120bd45b615091</data>
