      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Henkel's Leaf-tailed Gecko is a species of gecko native to Madagascar. It is mentioned in various parts of the document as being part of a zoo's collection and is listed under the 'More Animals From Africa' section. This species is highlighted as one of the animals from Africa and is potentially present at the zoo, indicating its significance and relevance in the zoo's exhibit.</data>
