    <node id="LAKE MALAWI CICHLIDS">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Lake Malawi cichlids are a group of fish species endemic to Lake Malawi, located in Tanzania, Mozambique, and Malawi. These cichlids are noted for their specific diets and varying living depths within the lake. They are part of the zoo's collection and are prominently featured in the 'More Animals From Africa' section of the document. Lake Malawi cichlids are highlighted as one of the notable animal species from Africa that are potentially present at the zoo.</data>
