      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The Mombasa Golden Starburst Tarantula is a species of tarantula native to Mombasa and is part of the Seneca Park Zoo's collection, specifically housed in the Animals of the Savanna building. This tarantula is known for feeding on invertebrates and small animals. It is featured in the zoo's exhibit as one of the animals from Africa and is also listed in the 'More Animals From Africa' section of the zoo's documentation.</data>
