      <data key="d0">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d1">The Olive Baboon is a species native to Africa and is part of the collection at Seneca Park Zoo. This troop consists of 10 individuals, including 6 females and 4 males, with Pimento being the dominant female. The Olive Baboon is featured in the zoo's "More Animals From Africa" section and is highlighted as one of the animals from Africa present at the zoo.</data>
