    <node id="NORTH AMERICAN RIVER OTTER">
      <data key="d0">SPECIES</data>
      <data key="d1">The North American River Otter is a mammal species native to North America and is listed under the 'More Animals from North America' section. This species has been the focus of relocation and conservation studies in the region. Over twenty years ago, the North American River Otter was reintroduced to the region by Seneca Park Zoo after being extirpated. It is also mentioned as one of the animals potentially present at the zoo.</data>
      <data key="d2">360b21cff28e96518b1080330f37b4f1,532641424d1ac585278bb60c24a09a1c,6d14ad0fec20f957fa86ed5bba9c5842,b444a72d50d13af97d816c1ebde75f41,f7d18cffd13aa901313d3d4fceef2575</data>
