    <node id="LEMURS AND MADAGASCAR">
      <data key="d0">PROJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">The conservation project in Madagascar, involving partnership with Dr. Patricia Wright, is focused on reforestation and biodiversity assessments. This initiative aims to enhance the ecological health of the region by restoring forest areas and conducting thorough biodiversity studies to monitor and support the diverse species native to Madagascar.</data>
      <data key="d2">9693c6d355708849ecd97fe93b0cd8f2,b444a72d50d13af97d816c1ebde75f41,f7d18cffd13aa901313d3d4fceef2575</data>
