      <data key="d0">SPECIES</data>
      <data key="d1">The Panamanian Golden Frogs are a critically endangered species of amphibians native to Panama. They are the focus of a conservation project aimed at ensuring their survival. These efforts are highlighted during the Panamanian Golden Frog Awareness Weekend, an event dedicated to raising awareness and support for the conservation of this endangered species.</data>
      <data key="d2">9693c6d355708849ecd97fe93b0cd8f2,9fbeec723e4f071989819b22d7317dc6,f7d18cffd13aa901313d3d4fceef2575</data>
