    <node id="ONE CUBIC FOOT MADAGASCAR">
      <data key="d0">PROJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">ONE CUBIC FOOT MADAGASCAR is a conservation science initiative led by the Zoo Society in Madagascar. It focuses on documenting biodiversity through a specific technique. The initiative involves a collaborative team that includes photographer David Liittschwager and scientists from the Smithsonian. This project aims to explore and record the diverse species found within a cubic foot of space in various ecosystems across Madagascar.</data>
      <data key="d2">2690f9504dfb56154145abcec34c3c4f,5c44b860bfe5a13d4dd428f89dc36b08</data>
