    <node id="SNOWY OWL">
      <data key="d0">ANIMAL, SPECIES</data>
      <data key="d1">The Snowy Owl is a male bird species that has recently arrived at Seneca Park Zoo. It is native to Arctic habitats and is protected under the U.S. Migratory Bird Act and CITES Appendix II. This species faces threats from human activities. The Snowy Owl is one of the animals potentially present at the zoo, as mentioned in the text.</data>
      <data key="d2">6d14ad0fec20f957fa86ed5bba9c5842,b2d180d00dbf4721b8ae9121fe3bd2b5,e9b8eaf510aa9cc4cf1ab929ac8c9706</data>
