    <node id="COMMUNITY CLEAN-UP &#8211; CONKEY CORNER PARK">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Community Clean-Up &#8211; Conkey Corner Park" is a local event dedicated to cleaning up Conkey Corner Park. It emphasizes local participation and environmental care, aiming to engage community members in maintaining and preserving their local environment. This event is one of several community clean-up initiatives focusing on enhancing the cleanliness and ecological health of the park.</data>
