      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"FAMILY TREK IN THE TWILIGHT" is an after-hours zoo event that offers guests a unique experience to explore the zoo. The event includes a pizza dinner, games, and animal interactions. Additionally, guests are treated to a guided tour, enhancing their understanding and enjoyment of the zoo's nocturnal environment. This event provides a comprehensive and engaging way for attendees to experience the zoo in a different light.</data>
      <data key="d2">360b21cff28e96518b1080330f37b4f1,4ca56498269e96d3b657d78ec7d10ccc,ede5b69e131b6efb49c20f681226707c</data>
