    <node id="COLD ASIA AWARENESS WEEKEND 2024">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">COLD ASIA AWARENESS WEEKEND 2024 is an event dedicated to raising awareness about the wildlife and environmental issues of cold climates in Asia. Scheduled for the year 2024, this event will feature expert naturalists who will provide insights into the adaptations of cold-climate animals in Asia. The focus will be on understanding the unique challenges faced by these animals and the broader environmental implications.</data>
