      <data key="d0">EXPANSION PROJECT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "Animals of the Savanna Expansion" at Seneca Park Zoo is an expansion project that encompasses a five-acre area dedicated to showcasing various savanna animals. This exhibit includes Masai giraffes, zebras, naked mole rats, and a white rhino, providing a comprehensive view of the diverse wildlife found in savanna ecosystems.</data>
