    <node id="TEACHER GUIDE">
      <data key="d0">RESOURCE</data>
      <data key="d1">The "TEACHER GUIDE" is a resource designed to assist teachers in facilitating learning. It aligns with both the Next Generation Science Standards (NGSS) and the New York State P-12 Science Learning Standards. This guide serves as an educational tool, suggesting its primary purpose is to support teachers in their instructional roles.</data>
