    <node id="CENTRE VALBIO">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">CENTRE VALBIO is a research and conservation center located in Ranomafana National Park, Madagascar. It functions as a field station and is supported by the zoo. The organization is staffed with individuals who work within the forest, providing essential support. The team involved in the related project stayed at CENTRE VALBIO and conducted part of their work there, leveraging the facilities and resources available.</data>
      <data key="d2">004c5ce5139f85c3462d8c6d33d0eb2c,58ac6437e7a6071aedb9431158b831ed,9693c6d355708849ecd97fe93b0cd8f2</data>
    </node>
