      <data key="d2">9693c6d355708849ecd97fe93b0cd8f2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AUDIO MOTHS">
      <data key="d0">TECHNOLOGY</data>
      <data key="d1">AUDIO MOTHS are open-source audio recorders specifically designed for wildlife research. These devices are utilized to capture high-frequency sounds produced by animals, aiding researchers in studying various species in their natural habitats.</data>
      <data key="d2">004c5ce5139f85c3462d8c6d33d0eb2c,9693c6d355708849ecd97fe93b0cd8f2</data>
    </node>
