    <node id="IVOHIBORO">
      <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d1">IVOHIBORO is a location that is central to both conservation efforts and research activities. Its story is being comprehensively told through organized and analyzed data collected from various sources, including audio, video, and photo files. This specific area is highlighted as critical for conservation, underscoring its ecological and scientific importance.</data>
      <data key="d2">004c5ce5139f85c3462d8c6d33d0eb2c,4f0216fbf293d41283768fcf5c6a176f</data>
