    <edge source="ZOO" target="ZOO MEMBERS">
      <data key="d4">37.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Zoo Members, associated with the Seneca Park Zoo through their membership, enjoy a range of special benefits and privileges at the Zoo. These include early access from April 1 through October 31, specific entry times, and other exclusive advantages that enhance their experience at the Zoo.</data>
