      <data key="d4">37.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The Rochester School for the Deaf is a key partner in organizing the Deaf Culture Awareness Day event, collaborating with the zoo to facilitate this occasion. This partnership highlights the school's active involvement in promoting deaf culture awareness.</data>
