    <edge source="SNOW LEOPARDS" target="COLD ASIA AWARENESS WEEKEND">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">During the Cold Asia Awareness Weekend event, Snow Leopards are a key topic of discussion and are prominently featured. This event focuses on raising awareness about various aspects of cold Asian regions, including the wildlife, with Snow Leopards being a significant point of interest.</data>
      <data key="d6">360b21cff28e96518b1080330f37b4f1,79a2d4b637ef8098cbe540902636ddbf</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SNOW LEOPARDS" target="COLD ASIA AWARENESS WEEKEND 2024">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">During the Cold Asia Awareness Weekend 2024, Snow Leopards are one of the main attractions and subjects of discussion. They are prominently featured throughout the event, highlighting their significance and raising awareness about their conservation.</data>
