    <edge source="ANIMAL FACTS" target="STATUS IN THE WILD">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The "Status in the Wild" section, which is part of the "Animal Facts" category, discusses the conservation status of various species as classified by the IUCN Red List. This section provides detailed information about the current conditions and threats facing wildlife in their natural habitats.</data>
